{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A setup command that rewrites tracked files can cause the reviewer to examine different content from the revision being evaluated and produce misleading findings."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"When both setup and control arms are evaluated for the same model, trial order can change the generated routing policy's reported pass rate."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Replay accepts setup mismatches and silently labels reused finder results as if they came from the requested environment."}]}